<essential_principles>

## Core Idea

UI consistency work produces **four artifacts** that serve as the single source of truth:

1. **STYLE_PICK.md** — visual direction (colors, typography, spacing, motion)
2. **DESIGN_DNA.md** — personality (density, trust, anti-patterns)
3. **COMPONENT_PLAN.md** — component specs (states, sizes, verification)
4. **UI_VERIFY.json** — browser-backed verification evidence

All artifacts live in `.gsd/ui-gates/` (unified directory).

## Three Execution Modes

| Mode | When | What happens |
|---|---|---|
| **simple** | < 50 UI files | Generate → audit → fix all → verify |
| **medium** | 50-200 UI files | Generate → audit → fix tokens → recommend refactor |
| **hard** | > 200 UI files | Generate → audit → no fixes → recommend refactor |

## Integration with Auto-Mode

After ui-consistency workflow completes:

1. **capture_thought()** for architectural insights (token patterns, component boundaries)
2. **Recommend /gsd auto** for implementation of fixes
3. **Auto-mode reads** `.gsd/ui-gates/` artifacts in discuss phase:
   ```
   Read .gsd/ui-gates/STYLE_PICK.md
   Read .gsd/ui-gates/DESIGN_DNA.md
   Read .gsd/ui-gates/COMPONENT_PLAN.md
   Read .gsd/ui-gates/AUDIT.md
   ```
4. **Memory injection** via loadMemoryBlock() carries insights from capture_thought()

## Guard Layer

Use `ui-ux-uat-gates` skill as verification guard:
- Run validator: `python3 ~/.agents/skills/ui-ux-uat-gates/scripts/validate-ui-gate-pack.py .gsd/ui-gates/`
- Check UI_VERIFY.json has fresh browser evidence
- Block completion if validator fails

</essential_principles>

<routing>

## Decision Tree

**No design system exists:**
→ Run full pipeline: generate → audit → fix → verify

**Design system exists, no audit:**
→ Run: audit → fix → verify

**Audit exists, need fixes:**
→ Run: fix-only workflow

**Quick check (no changes):**
→ Run: quick-scan workflow

**Unclear intent:**
→ Ask: "Do you want to (A) generate design system, (B) audit for drift, (C) fix known issues, or (D) quick scan?"

## Workflow Selection

| User says | Workflow | Mode |
|---|---|---|
| "Generate design system" | full-pipeline | simple/medium/hard |
| "Audit UI consistency" | full-pipeline | auto-detect |
| "Fix UI drift" | fix-only | from existing AUDIT.md |
| "Quick scan" | quick-scan | audit only |
| "Check design system" | quick-scan | verify existing |

</routing>

