**Command reference:**
| Flag | Effect |
|---|---|
| `--audit-only` | Force hard mode (audit only, no code changes) |
| `--fix` | Force simple mode (fix all, ignore complexity) |
| `--fix-tokens` | Force medium mode (fix tokens only) |
| `--scope=<path>` | Restrict to specific files/directory |

